{
  "an3.156:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 3 ",
  "an3.156:0.2": "16. Acelakavagga ",
  "an3.156:0.3": "~ ",
  "an3.156:1.1": "“Tisso imā, bhikkhave, paṭipadā. ",
  "an3.156:1.2": "Katamā tisso? ",
  "an3.156:1.3": "Āgāḷhā paṭipadā, nijjhāmā paṭipadā, majjhimā paṭipadā. ",
  "an3.156:1.4": "Katamā ca, bhikkhave, āgāḷhā paṭipadā? ",
  "an3.156:1.5": "Idha, bhikkhave, ekacco evaṁvādī hoti evaṁdiṭṭhi: ",
  "an3.156:1.6": "‘natthi kāmesu doso’ti. ",
  "an3.156:1.7": "So kāmesu pātabyataṁ āpajjati. ",
  "an3.156:1.8": "Ayaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, āgāḷhā paṭipadā. ",
  "an3.156:2.1": "Katamā ca, bhikkhave, nijjhāmā paṭipadā? ",
  "an3.156:2.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, ekacco acelako hoti muttācāro, hatthāpalekhano, naehibhadantiko, natiṭṭhabhadantiko, nābhihaṭaṁ na uddissakataṁ na nimantanaṁ sādiyati. ",
  "an3.156:2.3": "So na kumbhimukhā paṭiggaṇhāti, na kaḷopimukhā paṭiggaṇhāti na eḷakamantaraṁ na daṇḍamantaraṁ na musalamantaraṁ na dvinnaṁ bhuñjamānānaṁ na gabbhiniyā na pāyamānāya na purisantaragatāya na saṅkittīsu na yattha sā upaṭṭhito hoti na yattha makkhikā saṇḍasaṇḍacārinī na macchaṁ na maṁsaṁ na suraṁ na merayaṁ, na thusodakaṁ pivati. ",
  "an3.156:2.4": "So ekāgāriko vā hoti ekālopiko, dvāgāriko vā hoti dvālopiko … sattāgāriko vā hoti sattālopiko; ",
  "an3.156:2.5": "ekissāpi dattiyā yāpeti, dvīhipi dattīhi yāpeti … sattahipi dattīhi yāpeti; 